@PeopleHub_HostAddress = https://localhost:7059

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dashboard

### All four top cards in one call
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

### Hires per year since May 2011
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/hiring-by-year
Accept: application/json

### Department breakdown card
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/headcount-by-department
Accept: application/json

### Attendance chart, working days only
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/attendance-trend?days=14
Accept: application/json

### Who is in / remote / on leave / absent
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/team-status
Accept: application/json

### Latest request submissions and approvals
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/recent-activity?take=8
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Employees

### Page 1 of 200 employees — rows are in `items`
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/employees?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Filters combine freely
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/employees?department=Engineering&minSalary=1000&sort=salary&sortDir=desc
Accept: application/json

### Free-text search over name, code, email, phone, department, title
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/employees?keyword=ahmad
Accept: application/json

### One employee
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Accept: application/json

### Create
POST {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Lina",
  "middleName": "Omar",
  "lastName": "Haddad",
  "gender": "Female",
  "birthDate": "1995-03-14",
  "hireDate": "2026-01-05",
  "department": "Finance",
  "jobTitle": "Accountant",
  "salary": 780,
  "phoneNumber": "0791234567",
  "email": "lina.haddad@peoplehub.com",
  "maritalStatus": "Single"
}

### Update (whole object)
PUT {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ahmad",
  "middleName": "Omar",
  "lastName": "Khatib",
  "gender": "Male",
  "birthDate": "1990-06-02",
  "hireDate": "2015-04-11",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "jobTitle": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "salary": 1450,
  "phoneNumber": "0781234567",
  "email": "ahmad.khatib@peoplehub.com",
  "maritalStatus": "Married"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/employees/200

### --------------------------------------------------------------- Attendance

### Newest working day first
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/attendance?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Latest arrivals (office hours are 09:00-17:00)
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/attendance?sort=latestCheckIn&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Earliest arrivals
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/attendance?sort=earliestCheckIn&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### The page's three search fields
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/attendance?keyword=Engineering&name=ahmad&employeeCode=2018
Accept: application/json

### One day, only the late arrivals
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/attendance?date=2026-08-17&status=Late
Accept: application/json

### A date range, aggregated
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/summary?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------- Requests

### Defaults to the CURRENT MONTH
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Accept: application/json

### The boxes at the top of the page (all three status counts, always)
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests/summary
Accept: application/json

### Same boxes for today / this year
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests/summary?period=day
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests/summary?period=year
Accept: application/json

### The status toggle
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests?period=year&status=Pending&type=Leave
Accept: application/json

### One request
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests/1
Accept: application/json

### Create — starts as Pending whatever you send
POST {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "type": "Leave",
  "leaveType": "Annual",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-05",
  "reason": "Family vacation"
}

### Invalid — endDate before startDate, expect 400
POST {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 1,
  "type": "Leave",
  "startDate": "2026-09-05",
  "endDate": "2026-09-01",
  "reason": "Backwards on purpose"
}

### Approve / reject
PATCH {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved",
  "reviewedBy": "HR Manager"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/requests/1

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Financial

### Highest paid first
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/financial/salaries?sort=salary&sortDir=desc&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Totals for EVERYONE the filters matched, not just this page
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/financial/summary
Accept: application/json

### Totals for one department
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/financial/summary?department=Engineering
Accept: application/json

### Payroll split by department
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/financial/by-department
Accept: application/json

### Yearly payroll series + this-year-vs-last-year trend
GET {{PeopleHub_HostAddress}}/api/financial/payroll-by-year
Accept: application/json

